{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Pel model en sèrie, Q = ω₀L/ R i l' amplada de banda és R/ (ZXQPH0000QXZπL). Pel model paral· lel, Q = R/ (ω₀L) i l' amplada de banda és ZXQPH0001QXZ/ (ZXQPH0002QXZπRC). Aquestes són relacions de ressonància única ideals.","record_id":"51925e751dd6e540ff98e5e0edf3c77c6a3ddc8b89b210bfe2c643b3c3785419","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.6156802488749236,"source":"For the series model, Q = ω₀L/R and bandwidth is R/(2πL). For the parallel model, Q = R/(ω₀L) and bandwidth is 1/(2πRC). These are ideal single-resonance relationships.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d929113d31b49cd67fa0b70f4d3ec5403c3e4e89c98b4fcab359fb6074436c8a","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Pel model en sèrie, Q = ω₀L/ R i l' amplada de banda és R/ (2πL). Pel model paral· lel, Q = R/ (ω₀L) i l' amplada de banda és 1/ (2πRC). Aquestes són relacions de ressonància única ideals.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
